    "models": "Native SysML drives five ASCENT gates and derived D2. Existing QNT scheduling and Lean conditional input obligations remain distinct, unchanged and not rerun. Git/consumer/source refinement is checked against real objects and interfaces rather than asserted by duplicate formal models.",
